msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Language: zh_Hans\n"

msgid "QoS Marking (NSS)"
msgstr "NSS QoS 标记"

msgid "NSS Connections"
msgstr "NSS 实时连接"

msgid "NSS QoS Marking"
msgstr "NSS QoS 流量标记"

msgid "DSCP marking and prioritization for the NSS-accelerated SQM. Each rule marks both directions of matching connections; the NSS firmware applies the mark to accelerated (offloaded) traffic as well. Fast-laned flows bypass the SQM queues entirely — mark sparse traffic only (games, calls, DNS), never bulk transfers."
msgstr "针对 NSS 硬件加速 SQM 的 DSCP 标记与优先级调度。每条规则同时对匹配连接的双向流量生效；NSS 固件也会将标记应用于已卸载的加速流量。快速通道流将彻底旁路 SQM 队列直接放行 — 仅建议标记低延迟稀疏流量（如电竞游戏、语音通话、DNS），切勿用于大文件传输。"

msgid "Global"
msgstr "全局设置"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Master switch for all marking rules."
msgstr "所有标记规则的总开关。"

msgid "Wash ingress DSCP"
msgstr "重置入站 DSCP (Wash Ingress)"

msgid "Reset untrusted DSCP on packets arriving from the ISP to CS0. Marking rules below still re-mark what they match."
msgstr "将来自运营商 (ISP) 的不可信入站数据包 DSCP 重置为 CS0。下方的标记规则仍会重新标记匹配的流量。"

msgid "Wash egress DSCP"
msgstr "重置出站 DSCP (Wash Egress)"

msgid "Send all traffic to the ISP as CS0. Fast-lane prioritization is unaffected — it rides the internal priority mark, not the wire DSCP."
msgstr "向运营商发送的所有流量均标为 CS0。快速通道优先级不受影响 — 其依赖内部优先级标记，而非物理报文 DSCP。"

msgid "Rules"
msgstr "流控标记规则"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "已启用"

msgid "Name"
msgstr "规则名称"

msgid "Protocol"
msgstr "协议"

msgid "Source IP"
msgstr "源 IP 地址"

msgid "Hosts or CIDRs, space-separated, IPv4 and/or IPv6. Empty matches any."
msgstr "主机 IP 或 CIDR 网段，空格分隔，支持 IPv4 与 IPv6。留空匹配任意。"

msgid "Source ports"
msgstr "源端口"

msgid "One port or range per entry, e.g. '443' or '27015-27030'."
msgstr "每行一个端口或范围，例如 '443' 或 '27015-27030'。"

msgid "Destination IP"
msgstr "目标 IP 地址"

msgid "Destination domain"
msgstr "目标域名"

msgid "DNS names, re-resolved periodically on the router. A CDN whose per-stream subdomains share the zone's front-end addresses is covered by its apex name. Combines with Destination IP (either matches)."
msgstr "域名由路由器定期重新解析。子域名共享前端节点 IP 的 CDN 服务可直接使用根域名。可与目标 IP 组合生效（任一匹配即生效）。"

msgid "Destination ports"
msgstr "目标端口"

msgid "DSCP class"
msgstr "DSCP 优先级类别"

msgid "Fast lane"
msgstr "快速通道 (Fast Lane)"

msgid "Strict-priority lane ahead of the SQM queues, both directions. 'Automatic' enables it for EF, VA and CS4–CS7."
msgstr "位于 SQM 队列前方的双向绝对优先级通道。'自动' 模式下将自动为 EF、VA 与 CS4~CS7 激活。"

msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自动"

msgid "Always"
msgstr "总是"

msgid "Never"
msgstr "从不"

msgid "Proto"
msgstr "协议"

msgid "Source"
msgstr "源地址"

msgid "Destination"
msgstr "目标地址"

msgid "State"
msgstr "连接状态"

msgid "DSCP"
msgstr "DSCP 标记"

msgid "PPS"
msgstr "包速率 (PPS)"

msgid "Rate"
msgstr "传输速率"

msgid "Total"
msgstr "累计流量"

msgid "Click to sort"
msgstr "点击排序"

msgid "filter"
msgstr "输入关键字过滤"

msgid "No matching connections"
msgstr "无匹配连接"

msgid "Freeze"
msgstr "暂停刷新"

msgid "Resume"
msgstr "恢复刷新"

msgid "Live connection table with rates computed between polls — NSS-accelerated flows included (their counters are synced back from the firmware). The DSCP column shows classes applied by the QoS marking rules. Click a column header to sort; the row of boxes filters each column."
msgstr "实时连接监控表，速率根据轮询间隔动态计算 — 包含已卸载的 NSS 硬件加速流（计数器由固件回步至内核 conntrack）。DSCP 列显示经 QoS 规则标记的优先级分类。点击表头可排序，输入框可对各列进行实时过滤。"
